      ],
      "interpretation": "Local cache keyed by object id; only absent keys project. Consult previous run projection only if run and previous truthy; lookup by id. Reuse previous pair only if non-null and stored original is identical, not value-equal. Otherwise create replacement of point with mirrored fields. Exact PH becomes PL, other kind becomes PH; price sign copied. Reflect order snapshot and project cycle id. Recursively project truthy identity_source, else null; no cycle guard before recursion. Store projected point in local id cache after recursion. Only non-null run receives projection pair. Store original and projected object pair by id, including reused projection. Return cached projected point; existing cache avoids recomputation.",
